## 🔍 Memory Protection & Byte Patching (NOPing)

When modifying instructions directly in memory (e.g. disabling a check):

```cpp
void PatchMemory(void* dest, const void* src, size_t size) {
    DWORD oldProtect;
    VirtualProtect(dest, size, PAGE_EXECUTE_READWRITE, &oldProtect);
    memcpy(dest, src, size);
    VirtualProtect(dest, size, oldProtect, &oldProtect);
    FlushInstructionCache(GetCurrentProcess(), dest, size);
}

// Example: NOP out a 2-byte conditional jump (0x74 0x12 -> 0x90 0x90)
void DisableCheck(uintptr_t targetAddress) {
    const uint8_t nops[2] = { 0x90, 0x90 };
    PatchMemory((void*)targetAddress, nops, sizeof(nops));
}
```

